                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "01b63e57-78fd-34f7-b6de-dfcbb74d6819",
                        "entry_id": "b9531754-c62a-3709-9580-cc297a8c3f5b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "umowa zawierana z odpowiednią instytucją, która rozporządza pieniędzmi ubezpieczonych, pokrywając ich potrzeby na określonych warunkach"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "91e2b976-59ca-393d-a805-a212f88c55ac",
                        "entry_id": "b9531754-c62a-3709-9580-cc297a8c3f5b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "zabezpieczenie przed skutkami ryzykownych działań"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8e1ebf8-bf7d-42e4-8135-60b6e5d486cd",
                                "sense_id": "91e2b976-59ca-393d-a805-a212f88c55ac",
                                "text": "(…) Tuchaczewski musiał włączyć się do rozwiniętej już współpracy z Niemcami. Z uwagi na silną germanofobię, wyniesioną przede wszystkim z niewoli, przyszło mu to z pewnością niezbyt łatwo, niemniej rozumiał, iż polityka rapalleńska stanowi jedyną szansę szybkiego uzyskania nowoczesnego uzbrojenia, zaś zbliżenie z Republiką Weimarską – dobrą asekurację strategiczną ZSRS"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.2\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0b2f68e5-5ab6-3d5c-a70e-b365a97db332",
                        "entry_id": "b9531754-c62a-3709-9580-cc297a8c3f5b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "zabezpieczenie podczas wykonywania niebezpiecznych czynności jak np. wspinaczka"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cade5152-8b50-4246-a226-a34bc94bf453",
                                "sense_id": "0b2f68e5-5ab6-3d5c-a70e-b365a97db332",
                                "text": "Wprowadzenie heksów było dużym krokiem naprzód, umożliwiając asekurację w – niemal – równoległych szczelinach i tym samym pozwalając na podniesienie poziom wspinaczki klasycznej. Właściwie do dzisiaj pełnią one podobną rolę"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.3\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "924f0269-c355-437c-b903-9a6732318894",
                        "source_entry_id": "b9531754-c62a-3709-9580-cc297a8c3f5b",
                        "source_sense_id": "91e2b976-59ca-393d-a805-a212f88c55ac",
                        "target_lang_word": "assecuration",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "assecuration",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a985a015-4373-36d4-bf61-cafc1e7ad81d",
                                        "entry_id": "f9759fdc-baeb-3a85-9296-c77b1394bd73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Assurance; certainty."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5f4f6fe-843d-4a71-9cca-60e40dd7c6f6",
                                                "sense_id": "a985a015-4373-36d4-bf61-cafc1e7ad81d",
                                                "text": "This charge here, as it implies the possibility, so it signifies the convenience, use, profit, necessity of this assecuration: for sure, if it were not beneficial to us, it would never be thus forcibly urged upon us ."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8d6fdb7-0c01-4ade-9b6e-854844914592",
                                                "sense_id": "a985a015-4373-36d4-bf61-cafc1e7ad81d",
                                                "text": "Fritz has given me assecuration that the said paranymphal occasion will occur as suggested, and not on the Greek calends."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2329cc51-098f-44f4-ac97-f21ab484110c",
                                                "sense_id": "a985a015-4373-36d4-bf61-cafc1e7ad81d",
                                                "text": "It was only upon that assecuration, that we passed to the Turkish territory."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5f24ff3c-2290-3920-b34f-34d3dcdb75fd",
                                        "entry_id": "f9759fdc-baeb-3a85-9296-c77b1394bd73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Protection; safeguard; insurance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a6f133f-fe79-4f71-9837-dd48d915a052",
                                                "sense_id": "5f24ff3c-2290-3920-b34f-34d3dcdb75fd",
                                                "text": "Association for the assecuration of the Queen , subscribed by the members of Lincoln's Inn ( Egerton Papers 208 ) ."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d6d1f6f-1857-4d67-857e-fa4a8c55bb8d",
                                                "sense_id": "5f24ff3c-2290-3920-b34f-34d3dcdb75fd",
                                                "text": "A Proclamation made for the assecuration of the person of . . . . Paolo Servite, in execution of a Decree accorded, in the . . . .Councell of the Pregadie upon the 27. of Oct. 1607."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "873f7dd2-2790-4990-8b8f-7f12019e73ef",
                                                "sense_id": "5f24ff3c-2290-3920-b34f-34d3dcdb75fd",
                                                "text": "The hormones (ACTH, cortisone, Prednisone) recieved^([sic]) 36 patients in generally applied doses per os, i.m. or i.v. with antibiotics as an assecuration and with potassium salts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46554232-7603-428a-ad25-1d2c02a90223",
                                                "sense_id": "5f24ff3c-2290-3920-b34f-34d3dcdb75fd",
                                                "text": "The level of policey norms, technology, administrative communication, surveying and controlling by Cameralist administrators and all those elements of the real-assecuration are one part; but the discourses on insurance as an important form of financial post-damage recovery, the development of visual representation as a function of memory, but also of admonishing and advertising, next to all forms of the projects and scientific experiments that were also involved, and which Leibniz coined the verbal-assecuration of human societies, are also of great importance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "298aaa5f-5b30-381c-b398-911f5431070a",
                                        "entry_id": "f9759fdc-baeb-3a85-9296-c77b1394bd73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bill or charter outlining the rights granted and assured by Germanic Royalty in the late Middle Ages and early Renaissance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24b59a6d-65ed-4ea4-b58d-d1bb2edcf78d",
                                                "sense_id": "298aaa5f-5b30-381c-b398-911f5431070a",
                                                "text": "Since this second assecuration was acceptable to the Diet, which in return acknowledged Frederic William as the lawful and only prince, we shall be justified in regarding it, and the accompanying act of the Diet, as the instruments by which the public law of the province was brought into harmony with the new order of things."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "242aea67-e722-4bfe-99d5-935d670c1edc",
                                                "sense_id": "298aaa5f-5b30-381c-b398-911f5431070a",
                                                "text": "The “assecuration” of January 14, 1571, which permitted the lords and knights in Austria the free practice of religion, was the model for the religious settlement reached in Bruck in 1572, which, at first applicable only in Styria, provided a new legal status for the Augsburg Confession throughout Inner Austria."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa79a743-505e-44f7-b4e1-3003594a66e9",
                                                "sense_id": "298aaa5f-5b30-381c-b398-911f5431070a",
                                                "text": "In all the negotiations into which the Restitutor Germanieae (as Oxenstierna styled his master) now entered with the dispossessed Mecklenburg Dukes, with the House of Brunswick-Lüneburg, and with his Brandenburg brother-in-law, he showed himself resolved not only on the Pomeranian \"satisfaction,\" but also on an \"assecuration\" or safeguard."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6f8d5bea-120c-45e9-868a-09ec0f03c2db",
                        "source_entry_id": "b9531754-c62a-3709-9580-cc297a8c3f5b",
                        "source_sense_id": "91e2b976-59ca-393d-a805-a212f88c55ac",
                        "target_lang_word": "assurance",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "assurance",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c82d649b-a417-3ca1-9a09-7dd2a84ea21b",
                                        "entry_id": "70343442-20c2-3f89-a3a2-0b6a0cd51aa4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Certitude."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "adf6b5f8-2d3e-4737-a7ef-9925d35bed91",
                                                "sense_id": "c82d649b-a417-3ca1-9a09-7dd2a84ea21b",
                                                "text": "On ne peut plus douter de cette nouvelle, on en a une entière assurance. J’ai l’assurance que cette place me sera donnée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "357dfd57-8c3d-3c87-b1c8-4694a0c4ce74",
                                        "entry_id": "70343442-20c2-3f89-a3a2-0b6a0cd51aa4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Confiance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d43c887b-c4a8-4064-bc80-47785d87903b",
                                                "sense_id": "357dfd57-8c3d-3c87-b1c8-4694a0c4ce74",
                                                "text": "Prenez cette étoffe avec assurance, en assurance, elle est fort bonne. En toute assurance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d072636-46da-3280-a761-ac568ee1569b",
                                        "entry_id": "70343442-20c2-3f89-a3a2-0b6a0cd51aa4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Confiance en soi-même."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ead6afef-eedc-4ed0-ba07-18eebf547394",
                                                "sense_id": "3d072636-46da-3280-a761-ac568ee1569b",
                                                "text": "Choyé par les siens, protégé par ses aînés, il avait conquis l’assurance, l’arrogance presque de ceux qui se sentent forts, […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7512325b-1538-3efe-b318-c4ec8b4b444e",
                                        "entry_id": "70343442-20c2-3f89-a3a2-0b6a0cd51aa4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ensemble de paroles, de promesses, de protestations par lesquelles on s’efforce de donner à une personne la certitude de quelque chose, ou de lui inspirer de la confiance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7959013c-dd5c-46b4-9bcf-940f76813f86",
                                                "sense_id": "7512325b-1538-3efe-b318-c4ec8b4b444e",
                                                "text": "Ce ne sont pas là de vaines assurances, des assurances en l’air. — Donner à quelqu’un des assurances de sa fidélité, de son dévouement. — On lui a donné l’assurance qu’il serait nommé. Recevoir l’assurance d’une chose."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7495403a-4654-36d6-84ef-5764823c4935",
                                        "entry_id": "70343442-20c2-3f89-a3a2-0b6a0cd51aa4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hardiesse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a91bd321-e0da-4ac0-86b9-a2900e472459",
                                                "sense_id": "7495403a-4654-36d6-84ef-5764823c4935",
                                                "text": "Pour accuser avec une telle assurance, il fallait qu'existât la preuve indéniable de la félonie de François."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea11693b-8b19-4a28-8bd5-25841c2c2bfb",
                                                "sense_id": "7495403a-4654-36d6-84ef-5764823c4935",
                                                "text": "C’est un jeune acteur, qui n’a pas encore d’assurance. Prenez de l’assurance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32f54094-ef55-4b6a-9a73-083a0fb5c99d",
                                                "sense_id": "7495403a-4654-36d6-84ef-5764823c4935",
                                                "text": "Ayez plus d’assurance. Montrez de l’assurance. Perdre son assurance. Une noble assurance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b38f92eb-08fa-38a1-8bfc-8e1252e5cafe",
                                        "entry_id": "70343442-20c2-3f89-a3a2-0b6a0cd51aa4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sûreté ; état où l’on est hors de péril."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c24b0ac9-d3ad-40ba-842d-4041f21e3923",
                                                "sense_id": "b38f92eb-08fa-38a1-8bfc-8e1252e5cafe",
                                                "text": "Je l’ai mis en lieu d’assurance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dabc7d1c-0d97-3a17-af3f-18a96b0280ad",
                                        "entry_id": "70343442-20c2-3f89-a3a2-0b6a0cd51aa4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Promesse, obligation nantissement, etc., qu’on donne pour servir de sûreté à quelqu’un avec qui l’on traite."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08da4c06-8e2e-4a8d-8f67-cd3787a25e1f",
                                                "sense_id": "dabc7d1c-0d97-3a17-af3f-18a96b0280ad",
                                                "text": "Je vous donnerai vos assurances, une bonne assurance. C’est un homme dont il est prudent d’exiger des assurances."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "da9d98fc-58b4-3a88-8623-06cae1f14aed",
                                        "entry_id": "70343442-20c2-3f89-a3a2-0b6a0cd51aa4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Contrat par lequel on garantit contre certains risques sa personne ou son bien, ou par lequel, à de certaines conditions, on assure à soi ou à d’autres le paiement d’une somme convenue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3651689-cf25-455b-8c8c-f04dbdb6610f",
                                                "sense_id": "da9d98fc-58b4-3a88-8623-06cae1f14aed",
                                                "text": "Les sociétaires soumis à l’assurance obligatoire auront à supporter deux tiers du montant des cotisations, l'autre tiers est à la charge du patron."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebe46351-b972-40e2-817d-124e5387ca63",
                                                "sense_id": "da9d98fc-58b4-3a88-8623-06cae1f14aed",
                                                "text": "[…] des observateurs, […] signalent chez les campagnards du Lot comme une tare tout à fait caractéristique un individualisme outrancier, féroce, têtu, rétrograde qui leur a laissé ignorer jusqu'à ce jour les bienfaits de la solidarité, de l'entr’aide et même, dans bien des cas, de l'assurance et du remembrement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3e7f869b-4acc-4565-a87c-af1ae095bf0b",
                        "source_entry_id": "b9531754-c62a-3709-9580-cc297a8c3f5b",
                        "source_sense_id": "91e2b976-59ca-393d-a805-a212f88c55ac",
                        "target_lang_word": "Assekuranz",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Assekuranz",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a77f04df-eadc-358c-99bd-6afda957d20f",
                                        "entry_id": "6093ab53-daf4-3321-a489-63a44c313f2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unternehmen, das in Vereinbarungen meist gegen Entgelt anderen bei Eintritt bestimmter schädigender Ereignisse Ausgleich des Schadens zusagt; Versicherung(sgesellschaft)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "jargon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be04fae7-de58-4905-98e0-0726bb24a4c4",
                                                "sense_id": "a77f04df-eadc-358c-99bd-6afda957d20f",
                                                "text": "„Die Gründer wurden 2005 von der Schweizer Assekuranz mit dem Anerkennungspreis ausgezeichnet.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff651b83-84a4-4c96-b95b-444a142240e2",
                                                "sense_id": "a77f04df-eadc-358c-99bd-6afda957d20f",
                                                "text": "„Die Assekuranz betrachtet Umweltrisiken primär aus dem umwelthaftungsrechtlichen Blickwinkel.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c6856f8-98ea-4aa0-8778-aa5079428c25",
                                                "sense_id": "a77f04df-eadc-358c-99bd-6afda957d20f",
                                                "text": "„Rund 120 Millionen DM kostete die Assekuranz einer Explosion, die sich im Jahre 1985 in einer Ölraffinerie unweit Kölns ereignet hatte – der größte Einzelschaden in der Geschichte der Feuerversicherung.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46afb526-b54e-494a-9bba-fe4c092c6ac1",
                                                "sense_id": "a77f04df-eadc-358c-99bd-6afda957d20f",
                                                "text": "„Der Praxis helfen besonders überlegte Szenarien mit vorwiegend qualitativen Kriterien, die unter Wenn-dann-Aspekten versuchen, die Veränderungen des Marktes und daraus resultierende Konsequenzen für die Assekuranz insgesamt sowie für einzelne Unternehmen transparent zu machen und hieraus Folgen abzuleiten: Strategisches Controlling schlägt quantitative Scheingenauigkeit.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7c291fcf-0bac-4381-8d22-c0d60e0459c1",
                        "source_entry_id": "b9531754-c62a-3709-9580-cc297a8c3f5b",
                        "source_sense_id": "01b63e57-78fd-34f7-b6de-dfcbb74d6819",
                        "target_lang_word": "Versicherung",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Versicherung",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4d50b65-8579-31dd-99a6-cbd35e666e5a",
                                        "entry_id": "2588b34b-ae58-3487-946f-7c279a035984",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vereinbarung, bei der eine Partei meist gegen ein Entgelt der anderen bei Eintritt bestimmter schädigender Ereignisse einen Ausgleich des Schadens zusagt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0aa0559b-ff68-4173-8455-2c7830ed6ffe",
                                                "sense_id": "a4d50b65-8579-31dd-99a6-cbd35e666e5a",
                                                "text": "Ich habe eine Versicherung gegen Diebstahl abgeschlossen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36dbdb76-eff9-3e9e-b1e5-c0bbc64cef02",
                                        "entry_id": "2588b34b-ae58-3487-946f-7c279a035984",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unternehmen, das in Vereinbarungen meist gegen Entgelt anderen bei Eintritt bestimmter schädigender Ereignisse Ausgleich des Schadens zusagt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61e6d9dd-d326-4eed-8086-afbaaa5160d4",
                                                "sense_id": "36dbdb76-eff9-3e9e-b1e5-c0bbc64cef02",
                                                "text": "Meine Versicherung weigert sich, für den Schaden aufzukommen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27017fd4-19c8-457c-b960-82a86e53ebc4",
                                                "sense_id": "36dbdb76-eff9-3e9e-b1e5-c0bbc64cef02",
                                                "text": "„Céline hatte Cindy eine Versicherung verkauft.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "911f7010-a825-450e-a977-f81848e3e45f",
                                                "sense_id": "36dbdb76-eff9-3e9e-b1e5-c0bbc64cef02",
                                                "text": "„Heute sind die Schirme und ihre dreifachen Bremssysteme so ausgetüftelt, dass die Versicherungen das Snowkiten nicht mehr als Risikosport einstufen, sondern nur noch als Wagnis.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36d5a016-1ae1-4870-892a-f3b644cad9f7",
                                                "sense_id": "36dbdb76-eff9-3e9e-b1e5-c0bbc64cef02",
                                                "text": "„Hartmut arbeitet bei einer Versicherung als Gebietsleiter für Schleswig-Holstein.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d1afb6a-73f3-3a3e-9861-573b6840a527",
                                        "entry_id": "2588b34b-ae58-3487-946f-7c279a035984",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "nachdrückliche Bestätigung einer Person gegenüber, dass ein bestimmter Sachverhalt zutrifft"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "897521fd-ed51-4e5e-b91b-78949ae4b813",
                                                "sense_id": "0d1afb6a-73f3-3a3e-9861-573b6840a527",
                                                "text": "Deinen Versicherungen traue ich nicht mehr."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa855d3c-25f6-4374-ad44-23c6b9cc11c3",
                                                "sense_id": "0d1afb6a-73f3-3a3e-9861-573b6840a527",
                                                "text": "„Meine unter Erröten hervorgebrachte Versicherung, ich benötigte dieses Kleidungsstück nur zum Skilaufen, blieb unbeachtet.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cbd89f82-869a-4d39-82f0-4cb1c9fa2ee1",
                                                "sense_id": "0d1afb6a-73f3-3a3e-9861-573b6840a527",
                                                "text": "„Der Balken war nichts geringeres als der alte Galgen von Falaise, laut Versicherung des Tischlers, der ihn verkauft und diese Kenntnis von seinem Großvater hatte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
